Description: A small, dependable client for the S3 object store of the
    State of Pernambuco, Brazil ('s3.pe.gov.br', a 'Garage' server), and
    for any other S3-style store. Read and write data frames and files
    with read_s3() and write_s3(), chosen by file extension ('CSV',
    'JSON', 'Parquet', 'RDS', 'GeoJSON'), list, inspect and delete objects.
    Requests are signed with AWS Signature Version 4 over the real hash of
    the payload, transient failures are retried with exponential backoff,
    and every transfer is checked against the server's ETag and content
    length. Credentials come from the environment and are never written
    to disk.
